# The Sahagin's Key (outlands 128; call-only): the arms with no Gimb first. A level 99 Warrior in Sea Serpent Grotto,
# SahaginKeyProgress 0. Hurr at Progress 0: 104. Bou 108 (Progress 2: he reads no Progress). SahaginKeyItems 2 (a GM):
# Hurr at Progress 2 without the key: 105, Items 1 (the Progress 2 arm comes before the Items arms). Progress 4 (a GM):
# 104. Progress 3, Items 2, with no key (GMs): 106 (no roll: Items is not 0).
char zone=SeaSerpentGrotto pos=307.4,27.768,234.3 job=WAR lvl=99
login
trigger Hurr_the_Betrayer                 # Progress 0: 104
finish
warp -123.5,47.568,-334.8 SeaSerpentGrotto
trigger Bou_the_Righteous                 # 108, Progress 2
finish
warp 307.4,27.768,234.3 SeaSerpentGrotto
charvar SahaginKeyItems 2                 # a GM
trigger Hurr_the_Betrayer                 # Progress 2, no key: 105, Items 1
finish
charvar SahaginKeyProgress 4              # a GM
trigger Hurr_the_Betrayer                 # Progress 4: 104
finish
charvar SahaginKeyProgress 3              # a GM
charvar SahaginKeyItems 2
trigger Hurr_the_Betrayer                 # Progress 3, Items 2: 106
finish
